WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.250
Meet Tilly.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.570
She’s your long job, and she can’t stop.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.630
Next door, another app can pause its jobs.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.990
You want that.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.780
So you copy its button into both your apps.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.670
Tilly presses it.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:17.510
Nothing.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.180
Underneath, there is no pause to call.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.280
Transfer watches what the button does.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.940
Running, paused, resumed.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.040
The donor code stays put.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.110
It checks what your apps already have.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.930
The real gap is underneath.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.710
So the shared pause lands first.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.990
Then each app adds it in its own style.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.070
The test comes from the donor, and runs in each real app.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.600
Until then, it says not verified.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:04.210
Transfer.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.070
Bring the behavior to the app you use.
